Translation Hub data license
============================

This license applies ONLY to the data files inside the translation-hub/ directory
(the per-source translation files and index.json). It does not apply to the program
code anywhere else in this repository, which stays under the MIT License in the
repository root LICENSE file.

The translations stored here are community- and AI-generated translated text, licensed
under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
license (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/
    Legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode

Exception: a data file that carries a "license" field (and its entry in index.json) is
licensed under the license that field names instead. This is the case for translations of
projects released under an LGPL license (for example LGPL-3.0-only): such a translation keeps
that license. Where one file merges several sources, every license listed in the field applies
to it.

This directory does not contain, and does not license, any original source text.
Original text, names and trademarks remain the property of their respective owners
(the game, server and mod authors). Nothing here is affiliated with, endorsed by or
sponsored by Mojang, Microsoft, any server (for example Hypixel) or any mod author.

Attribution: "Nyanlex Translation Hub contributors" with a link to this repository.

Takedown: rights holders can open an issue, see translation-hub/README.md.
